{"title":"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/c/b2c1852db4d5ea79f93af4686b7294e41c40811e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+mx+n=0 ,m \\ne 0,n \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"242\" height=\"19\" />, then the sum of the roots is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/b/63b1d86d4ee08bf83c7ed6b4cfc4819c6ddfb433.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } -\\frac{1}{2}\\quad \\text{(B) } -1\\quad \\text{(C) } \\frac{1}{2}\\quad \\text{(D) } 1\\quad \\text{(E) } \\text{undetermined}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"407\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By Vieta's Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/9/af9f5611adc06ee969ae400225737827c10a58d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mn = n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/4/e4484cc1594558ab41bdebcb7feb6e66be1bf061.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(m + n) = m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />. Dividing the first equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/b/73baad1d05e4bc4d4067fd6dfcc164e339bf981a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />. Multiplying the 2nd by -1 gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/5/1e574560e61aa71a41c594ba495b5cc220ad41c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m + n = -m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"12\" />. The RHS is -1, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME\" title=\"1968 AHSME\">1968 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1968 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1968\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink sel